t-[#324E64] hover:bg-[#F3BA43]/90 font-semibold shadow-sm\">Contact Us</button></a></div></nav></header><main class=\"flex-grow\"><div class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"relative bg-[#1E3448] overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0\"><img alt=\"Advanced agro-food cleaning and sorting machine facility\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center opacity-30 mix-blend-overlay\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 sm:py-32 lg:px-8 lg:py-40\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl leading-tight\">Advanced Agro-Processing Machines</h1><p class=\"mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300\">Engineering innovation, trust, and precision into every machine we build.</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 sm:gap-x-6\"><a href=\"/contact\"><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"button\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-clip-padding text-sm whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive