v></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 pt-12 pb-24 sm:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#324E64] sm:text-4xl\">Our Company Features</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600\">At Tavasya Machine Solutions, we combine engineering expertise with innovation to redefine the standards of agro-food cleaning and processing.<br/>From design to installation, every step reflects our commitment to quality, precision, and sustainability.</p></div><div class=\"mx-auto mt-16 max-w-2xl sm:mt-20 lg:mt-24 lg:max-w-none\"><dl class=\"grid max-w-xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-16 md:grid-cols-2 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 p-8\"><dt class=\"text-xl font-bold leading-7 text-[#324E64]\">Advanced Cleaning Technology</dt><dd class=\"mt-4 flex flex-auto flex-col text-base leading-7 text-slate-600\"><p class=\"flex-auto font-medium text-slate-900\">Delivering next-generation cleaning systems designed for accuracy, efficiency, and reliability.</p><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-base-ui-click-trigger=\"\" id=\"base-ui-_R_6rd2nqbrb_\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"mt-6 text-sm font-semibold text-[#F3BA43] hover:text-[#324E64] transition-colors text-left focus:outline-none\">Read More →</button></dd></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 p-8\"><dt class=\"text-xl font-bold leading-7 text-[#324E64]\">End-to-End Engineering Excellence</dt><dd class=\"mt-4 flex flex-auto flex-col text-base leading-7 text-slate-600\"><p class=\"flex-auto font-medium text-slate-900\">From concept to commissioning, we provide fully integrated solutions tailored to your needs.</p><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-base-ui-click-trigger=\"\" id=\"base-ui-_R_6rl2nqbrb_\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"mt-6 text-sm font-semibold text-[#F3BA43] hover:text-[#324E64] transition-colors text-left focus:outline-none\">Read More →</button></dd></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 p-8\"><div class=\"relative h-48 w-full rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-6\"><img alt=\"A peanut plant has been pulled from the soil, exposing multiple peanut pods attached to its roots.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontext%2Fharvested-peanut-plant.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontext%2Fharvested-peanut-plant.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontext%2Fharvested-peanut-plant.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontext%2Fharvested-peanut-plant.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontext%2Fharvested-peanut-plant.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontext%2Fharvested-peanut-plant.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontext%2Fharvested-peanut-plant.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontext%2Fharvested-peanut-plant.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontext%2Fharvested-peanut-plant.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><dt class=\"text-xl font-bold leading-7 text-[#324E64]\">Sustainability &amp; Customer Commitment</dt><dd class=\"mt-4 flex flex-auto flex-col text-base leading-7 text-slate-600\"><p class=\"flex-auto font-medium text-slate-900\">Innovating responsibly to create lasting value for customers and the planet.</p><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-base-ui-click-trigger=\"\" id=\"base-ui-_R_6rt2nqbrb_\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"mt-6 text-sm font-semibold text-[#F3BA43] hover:text-[#324E64] transition-c